<title>USA: Urohealth files for 5.0 mln.</title>
<headline>Urohealth files for 5.0 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Urohealth Systems Inc filed Thursday with the Securities and Exchange Commission to offer up to 5.0 million common shares.</p>
<p>Of the total, 2.5 million will be sold by the company and 2.5 million will be sold by shareholders, the filing said.</p>
<p>Net proceeds will be used to repay $5.0 million of debt under a term-credit facility, reduce debt under a revolving credit facility by $15 million and for general corporate purposes, including future acquisitions.</p>
<p>The offering will be made through Bear, Stearns &amp; Co Inc, Piper Jaffray Inc, and Needham &amp; Co Inc. The underwriters have an over-allotment option for up to 750,000 additional shares.</p>
</text>
